'''Megurine Luka''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 9.8 Update|version 9.8]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 560
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Megurine Luka
|name2 = Megurine Luka CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Megurine Luka CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Megurine Luka works well against Dark Enemies, usually knocking them back with each hit while maintaining a fast attack rate. She is also a good counter for [[Pigeon de Sable|Pigeons]] and [[Brollow]]s. Her blind spot is low enough to not be a problem, unlike other LD units, but it also causes her to stay very close to the enemy base when she reaches it, which, of course, puts her in great danger. At high levels, she can constantly knock [[Gobble]] back, given the correct timing.

Her fatal weakness is her survivability. Most ubers average at about three knockbacks, however Luka only has two, which when combined with her mediocre standing range, means that she'll go down much quicker than other ubers.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper}}

